ChangeLog file for activeMonitr

v0.0.3 - (2026-06-04) Modernized for current R (4.4+), ggplot2 4.x, dplyr 1.x.
    Fixed calc_monitoring_costs() (broke under current tibble row-assignment).
    Updated deprecated ggplot2/dplyr calls (panel.spacing, guide="none",
    legend.position="inside", slice_sample, summarize(.groups), tibble).
    Moved package dependencies from Depends to Imports/Suggests; dropped unused
    reshape2 and Cairo; declared MASS/scales/DT/shiny; added @importFrom and
    regenerated NAMESPACE/man. Added small (5,000-row) thinned posterior views
    (pstr_gamma_params_*_small) so the Shiny app runs low-memory; the full
    posteriors remain canonical and are regenerable via
    inst/analysis-code/make-app-data.R. Switched the app's data table to DT and
    prepared shinyapps.io deployment.

v0.0.2 - (2020-02-05) Updated plotting function to include smoother integration over posterior distribution and unknown exposure time, with contributions from Stephen Lauer.

v0.0.1 - Initial release of package

